{"id":"en_leaving-the-toxic-family-behind","title":"Leaving The Toxic Family Behind","titleEn":"Leaving The Toxic Family Behind","description":"When she comes home for the holidays, a young woman learns of her father's hidden affair, and both she and her mother are thrown out of the house. Rather than collapse under the blow, the two choose to fight back. They confront uncaring relatives and build a large livestream business of their own, gradually taking back control of their lives. Along the way, she helps her mother discover a renewed sense of purpose and stumbles upon a secret that changes everything. In the end, the toxic father is left with nothing but regret.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/leaving-the-toxic-family-behind/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/leaving-the-toxic-family-behind/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Family Drama","Karma Payback","Underdog Rise"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dvhxg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_leaving-the-toxic-family-behind_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dvhxg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_leaving-the-toxic-family-behind_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dvhxg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_leaving-the-toxic-family-behind_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dvhxg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_leaving-the-toxic-family-behind_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (